== BUNDLED MODEL WEIGHTS ==

`sahu65/models/clip_encoder.int8.onnx` is an INT8 dynamically-quantized export of the
image tower of `openai/clip-vit-base-patch16` (CLIP ViT-B/16), revision
`57c216476eefef5ab752ec549e440a49ae4ae5f3`. `sahu65/models/clip_head.json` holds 512 probe
weights and a bias fitted by this project.

The upstream OpenAI CLIP model is distributed under the MIT License. The Hugging Face Hub
metadata for the repository declares no licence field, so that is recorded here as stated by
the upstream model card rather than asserted: confirm the licence with OpenAI/Microsoft
before a commercial release if that matters to you.

Consequences for anyone installing or redistributing this package:

  * The bundled weights are expected to be usable commercially. If you need certainty,
    verify the upstream terms first.
  * The previous release bundled `Organika/sdxl-detector` (Swin-T), licensed
    **CC BY-NC 3.0** -- non-commercial. That restriction applied to everything shipped in
    the package. It was removed in 2026.11.0 by replacing that checkpoint with the CLIP
    probe; see MODEL_CARD.md 1 for the measured comparison. Earlier revisions of this
    LICENSE, README and MODEL_CARD incorrectly recorded the sdxl-detector checkpoint as
    Apache-2.0 and stated that commercial use was permitted. That was wrong.

The MIT License text for the encoder is reproduced above, under "== CODE ==".